      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Set up the pilot's phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Drones</strong>, open <strong>Settings</strong>, tap <strong>Pilot</strong>, then <strong>Pick</strong> your team under <strong>Unit</strong>. Tap <strong>‹</strong> to open the pilot page.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8ffe854b8953a0d0.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Wait for the flight",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The page waits for a flight from your team and shows the accepted strike under it. The screen stays on.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9a2ef456aad2d18c.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "No drone position yet",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Once your team takes off, the page shows the strike and its target. Until your team picks the drone track it says <strong>No drone position</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b322f55922d1fbc2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Fly by the numbers",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Fly by the big bearing and the arrow, drawn <strong>North up</strong>. <strong>Corridor edge</strong> says how far the drone is from leaving its area, left or right as it faces the target.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/917b6992187d84ff.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Map</strong> on the pilot page shows the target on the map. Tap <strong>Drones</strong> to come back.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9d68eb46b510eedd.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
